a key="表演者" value="HOYO-MiX"/><amll:meta key="表演者" value="Chevy"/><amll:meta key="表演者" value="知更鳥"/><amll:meta key="表演者" value="ロビン"/><amll:meta key="表演者" value="로빈"/><amll:meta key="表演者" value="Robin"/><amll:meta key="词曲作者" value="黑金雨"/><amll:meta key="词曲作者" value="windflowerLia"/><amll:meta key="音樂創作人" value="黑金雨"/><amll:meta key="音樂創作人" value="windflowerLia"/><amll:meta key="실연자" value="知更鸟"/><amll:meta key="실연자" value="HOYO-MiX"/><amll:meta key="실연자" value="Chevy"/><amll:meta key="실연자" value="知更鳥"/><amll:meta key="실연자" value="ロビン"/><amll:meta key="실연자" value="로빈"/><amll:meta key="실연자" value="Robin"/><amll:meta key="작곡가" value="王可鑫"/><amll:meta key="작사가 겸 작곡가" value="黑金雨"/><amll:meta key="작사가 겸 작곡가" value="windflowerLia"/><amll:meta key="편곡자" value="王可鑫"/><amll:meta key="편곡자" value="崔瀚普"/><amll:meta key="편곡자" value="TSAR"/><amll:meta key="프로듀서" value="王可鑫"/><amll:meta key="프로듀서" value="宫奇"/><amll:meta key="프로듀서" value="宮奇"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="68000793"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="planegenes"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">风将吹向何方，谁也捉摸不透</text><text for="L2">气球又会系着我去哪漫游？</text><text for="L3">当音符的骤雨，如星辉般洒落</text><text for="L4">我任由它们交织，写出一首随性的新曲</text><text for="L5">找准你的节奏，你的步调 <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(慢板、急板、行板、或者小广板？)</span></text><text for="L6">加入这场竞演，准备开场</text><text for="L7">像不协和音一样~</text><text for="L8">随性发挥！摆脱僵滞的谱面！</text><text for="L9">摇摆起来！我们可不是零件！</text><text for="L10">拿下胜利！成为最亮眼的高音！</text><text for="L11">准备去惊艳全场</text><text for="L12">自由地，放声歌唱！</text><text for="L13">喔！哦！哦！哦！哦！保持律动，跟上节拍</text><text for="L14">喔！哦！哦！哦！哦！跃向高空，展翅飞翔</text><text for="L15">喔！哦！哦！哦！哦！加速，行动，去证明</text><text for="L16">喔！哦！哦！哦！哦！跃向高空，展翅飞翔</text><text for="L17">嘿！还在纠结？把疑虑抛开！</text><text for="L18">出发，油门踩到底，切入音色！</text><text for="L19">嗯~ 调整步调，节奏加快！</text><text for="L20">出绝招，全速启动，音浪推高！</text><text for="L21">点亮千星，引擎超载！</text><text for="L22">电频激荡，终点线近在眼前</text><text for="L23">振翅同飞的鸟儿们，在此刻集结~</text><text for="L24">自由地，放声歌唱！</text><text for="L25">随性发挥！摆脱僵滞的谱面！</text><text for="L26">摇摆起来！我们可不是零件！</text><text for="L27">拿下胜利！成为最亮眼的高音！</text><text for="L28">一起来，让我听见你们的呼声 <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(一起来，让我听见你们的呼声)</span></text><text for="L29">扫下属于你们的和弦，耶！</text><text for="L30">喔！哦！哦！哦！哦！保持律动，跟上节拍</text><text for="L31">喔！哦！哦！哦！哦！跃向高空，展翅飞翔</text><text for="L32">喔！哦！哦！哦！哦！加速，行动，去证明</text><text for="L33">喔！哦！哦！哦！哦！跃向高空，展翅飞翔</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>王可鑫</songwriter><songwriter>黑金雨</songwriter><songwriter>windflowerLia</songwriter></songwriters><transliterations/></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="2:02.090"><div begin="9.590" end="25.850" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="9.590" end="13.200" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.590" end="9.840">Who </span><span begin="9.840" end="10.060">can </span><span begin="10.060" end="10.400">sure</span><span begin="10.400" end="10.630">ly </span><span begin="10.630" end="11.010">know</span> <span begin="11.580" end="11.850">how </span><span begin="11.850" end="12.060">the </span><span begin="12.060" end="12.300">wind </span><span begin="12.300" end="12.410">b</span><span begin="12.410" end="13.050">low</span><span begin="13.050" end="13.200">s</span></p><p begin="13.520" end="17.210" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.520" end="13.760">Where </span><span begin="13.760" end="13.980">the </span><span begin="13.980" end="14.230">bal</span><span begin="14.230" end="14.440">loon</span><span begin="14.440" end="14.510">’s </span><span begin="14.510" end="14.870">ta</span><span begin="14.870" end="15.440">king </span><span begin="15.440" end="15.760">me </span><span begin="15.760" end="16.110">to </span><span begin="16.110" end="17.060">roam</span><span begin="17.